WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.857
By the end, your own contractor form Sheet runs on your own Google account.

2
00:00:04.857 --> 00:00:05.560
Five steps.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.433
Open my link.

4
00:00:07.433 --> 00:00:12.080
This Sheet lives on my account, so first we make your own copy.

5
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:16.834
Click File, top left, then Make a copy.

6
00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:18.100
A small box opens.

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.260
Give it a name you'll recognise, and click Make a copy.

8
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.754
It opens in a new tab.

9
00:00:26.754 --> 00:00:27.876
This one's yours:

10
00:00:27.876 --> 00:00:29.560
your contractor form Sheet.

11
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.424
Now your copy sets itself up.

12
00:00:32.424 --> 00:00:35.400
At the top, click the menu Contractor intake.

13
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.400
Then the first line, Set up now.

14
00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.145
The first time, Google asks:

15
00:00:43.145 --> 00:00:45.509
may this copy work in your account?

16
00:00:45.509 --> 00:00:46.100
Click OK.

17
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.781
Google's window opens.

18
00:00:49.781 --> 00:00:53.082
Pick your account, Advanced, Go to, then Allow.

19
00:00:53.082 --> 00:00:56.520
Unsafe only means Google hasn't checked your copy.

20
00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:02.980
Back in your Sheet, click Contractor intake, then Set up now again.

21
00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:07.575
It asks who's already in this Sheet.

22
00:01:07.575 --> 00:01:08.257
Click Yes.

23
00:01:08.257 --> 00:01:11.420
That clears out my test people, so you start empty.

24
00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:15.184
When you see Done, click OK.

25
00:01:15.184 --> 00:01:17.429
It even tells you the next step:

26
00:01:17.429 --> 00:01:18.450
the Gemini key.

27
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.390
Your form reads résumés with Google's AI, called Gemini.

28
00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:28.240
For that, it needs your own free key.

29
00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:32.778
Get it at aistudio dot google dot com.

30
00:01:32.778 --> 00:01:36.260
This button, Create API key, gives you yours.

31
00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:40.420
Click Create API key, then copy it.

32
00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:42.808
Back in your Sheet:

33
00:01:42.808 --> 00:01:46.160
click Contractor intake, then Add the Gemini key.

34
00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:51.060
A box opens.

35
00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.044
Paste your key and click OK.

36
00:01:53.044 --> 00:01:55.850
It's kept private, never shown in a cell.

37
00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:02.860
When it says Key saved, click OK.

38
00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:06.550
The Gemini key line on your Setup tab turns OK.

39
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:08.855
Key's in.

40
00:02:08.855 --> 00:02:09.367
Next:

41
00:02:09.367 --> 00:02:10.820
turn the form on.
